Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.61,0:00:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.81,0:00:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.81,0:00:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.75,0:01:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.66,0:01:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yug.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.57,0:01:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't he answer us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.11,0:01:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen him like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.71,0:01:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He's totally out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.95,0:01:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he did just lose his only\Nchance to save his grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.21,0:01:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, let us help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.49,0:01:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What is happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.79,0:01:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike now or I swear I'll take you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.97,0:01:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, I've never backed away\Nand I'm not starting now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.07,0:01:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,One minute I'm battling\Nagainst Kaiba. Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.31,0:01:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The next minute I'm battling with myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.01,0:01:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly there was this\Nother presence inside of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.01,0:01:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,willing to do anything to win the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.23,0:01:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And it took everything I\Nhad just to hold him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.81,0:01:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But that gave Kaiba the opening he needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.19,0:01:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I let Kaiba win the match,\Nbut I had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.37,0:01:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That other presence might have seriously\Nhurt Kaiba if I hadn't regained control.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.73,0:01:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'm afraid of\Nwhat happens next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.13,0:01:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens if I can't control it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.07,0:02:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't take that chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.25,0:02:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And that means I can never duel again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.81,0:02:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we have to do something, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.79,0:02:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, all right. I'm going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.81,0:02:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.17,0:02:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You just lost a few star chips, is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.25,0:02:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, take mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.75,0:02:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you big time for\Never getting me this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.39,0:02:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.30,0:02:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.35,0:02:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.29,0:02:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, she needs my help, but\NGramps is in danger right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.57,0:02:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get Yugi into the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.59,0:02:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.93,0:02:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, pal. What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.07,0:02:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go kick Pegasus' sorry\Nbutt and get your grandpa back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.41,0:02:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, Yug.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to have him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.09,0:02:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I can never duel again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.25,0:02:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, snap out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.95,0:02:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really starting to scare me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.53,0:02:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to help you out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.97,0:02:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull yourself together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.21,0:02:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, Joey. Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.19,0:02:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is how you treat your friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.87,0:02:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see how\Nyou treat your enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.39,0:02:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.69,0:02:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.07,0:02:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.98,0:02:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If you guys have enough star\Nchips to get into the castle,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.65,0:02:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,why are you hanging out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.07,0:02:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.09,0:03:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He lost his chips to Kaiba, and\Nnow it's like he's lost the will...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.35,0:03:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,to go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.59,0:03:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So the little guy finally lost one, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.37,0:03:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky for you guys I came by.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.93,0:03:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.71,0:03:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I played your game and won.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.97,0:03:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.45,0:03:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Kaiba boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.25,0:03:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we toast him, Croquet? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.59,0:03:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A toast to Kaiba and his\Nstunning upset victory over Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.91,0:03:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.17,0:03:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,if he thinks he can just waltz in here\Nand rescue his poor little brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.41,0:03:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,then he overestimates his chances\Nand underestimates my abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.65,0:03:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But he'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.87,0:03:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll see soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.59,0:03:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, now listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.69,0:03:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially you, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.55,0:03:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You got beat, but that doesn't\Nmean it's the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.93,0:03:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,When I got beat, I thought\Nit was all over for me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.11,0:03:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But then Yugi stepped in and saved my star\Nchips, and now I'm returning the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.31,0:04:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.85,0:04:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.76,0:04:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Without those, you can't\Nwin the prize money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.63,0:04:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm being kind, not stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.29,0:04:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, she already has ten chips of her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.13,0:04:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder she's being\Nso generous. Way off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.35,0:04:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go on, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.05,0:04:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You know I owe you, so take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.51,0:04:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Earth to Yugi, star chips at 12 o 'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.33,0:04:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and take my star chips, Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.91,0:04:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and then we can all head\Nup to the castle together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.83,0:04:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What, are my star chips\Nnot good enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.13,0:04:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, then I'll keep them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.91,0:04:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And your friends can wipe your nose\Nall the way back to the nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.71,0:04:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.62,0:04:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes you win, sometimes you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.33,0:04:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai, don't get mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.65,0:04:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You just don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.97,0:04:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.93,0:04:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend lost one lousy duel, and\Nnow he's too chicken to play again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.59,0:04:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.83,0:04:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.74,0:04:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,it come on chicken boy duel
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.69,0:04:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,me for them now i'll duel you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.21,0:05:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,that's right i'll duel you\Nright here right now for yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.23,0:05:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.97,0:05:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and me right here right now\Nyugi needs those star chips and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.15,0:05:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to win him for him.\NCome on, be serious, an amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.77,0:05:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,like you wouldn't stand a\Nchance against me would so hun
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.99,0:05:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,it's sweet you standing up for\Nyugi and all but sweet doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.31,0:05:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,win duels now i'll ask you\None last time are you sure you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.13,0:05:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to duel me? What do you think?\NI think Yugi's in good hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.41,0:05:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,i sure hope you're right buddy because\Neverything's riding on this one match
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.27,0:05:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So what do you say, Taya? You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.91,0:05:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,totally let's go it's time to duel
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.03,0:06:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki's still lost in\Nhis own head. Well maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.11,0:06:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,a little duel action\Nwill snap him out of it
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.47,0:06:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,all right my I'm playing the\Npetite angel in attack mode
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.71,0:06:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.61,0:06:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Taya, that is not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.87,0:06:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Harpy Lady Attack Mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.57,0:06:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll lay this, too, face\Ndown. Right, um... Attack, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.71,0:06:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.62,0:06:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.79,0:06:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Taya, if you're trembling\Nwith fear after just the first round,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.79,0:06:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe you should quit right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.15,0:06:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, Mai!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.99,0:07:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in it to win it! Go! Fairy's gift!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.09,0:07:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, another of these cutesy cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.69,0:07:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, what are we\Nhaving, a duel or a pageant?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.59,0:07:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.27,0:07:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wabaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.69,0:07:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.33,0:07:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.59,0:07:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,A powerful one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.85,0:07:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I can remember what it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.13,0:07:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Think, Taya, think. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.33,0:07:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I just better figure it out\Nbefore I really need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.81,0:07:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.43,0:07:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.03,0:07:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.01,0:07:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.92,0:07:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A rocky start, but I think\NTaya's back on track.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.63,0:07:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're right, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.29,0:07:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is riding on this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.47,0:07:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.47,0:07:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Fairy's gift!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.59,0:07:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack with enchanted dust!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.35,0:07:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What's taking so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.05,0:07:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My fairy's attack power is\Nhigher than that Harpy's.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.81,0:07:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be taking her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.81,0:07:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.47,0:07:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.39,0:08:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.43,0:08:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, hon, but I activated my magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.51,0:08:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The Rose Whip, a personal favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.81,0:08:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It gives my harpy 300 extra attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.11,0:08:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,More than enough to defend her\Nfrom your silly pigskinness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.59,0:08:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And take out your fairy as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.29,0:08:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late to call off\Nmy fairy's attack now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.83,0:08:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to hope for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.53,0:08:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my harpy lady, whiplash attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.39,0:08:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.99,0:08:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Your fairy turned to dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.91,0:08:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Clever move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.29,0:08:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai tricked Tea into attacking by making
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.83,0:08:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,her think that her fairy\Nhad the most points.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.13,0:09:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But what Mai didn't reveal\Nuntil after Tea attacked was
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.13,0:09:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,that she had a magic card waiting\Nto power up her hobby lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.29,0:09:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Another mistake like\Nthat and it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.29,0:09:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If you had any idea what\Nyou're really up against,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.93,0:09:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya, you'd call it quits right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.39,0:09:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't going to get\Nany easier, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.25,0:09:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give up and go back to cheerleading.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.05,0:09:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not going to let Yugi down, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.15,0:09:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, if this is the start of\Nsome friendship rant, just save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.91,0:09:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard all your lame speeches before,\Nand from that look on Yugi's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.83,0:09:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say he has, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.55,0:09:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.55,0:09:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.47,0:09:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone sees how scared you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.87,0:09:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a little girl who's\Naccidentally stumbled into the big leagues.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.03,0:09:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But whatever, you'll learn the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.91,0:09:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Harpy's feather duster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.25,0:09:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn, hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.75,0:09:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm playing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.39,0:09:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.77,0:09:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Face down again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.15,0:09:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate it when she does that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.97,0:10:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes it hard to know what to play next.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.61,0:10:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Shining friendships.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.19,0:10:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's like all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.25,0:10:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all in this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.71,0:10:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, I wish this card was as\Nstrong as our real friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.01,0:10:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it would be able to beat anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.39,0:10:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It would have Joey's courage,\NTristan's spirit, and Yugi's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.23,0:10:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.49,0:10:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We're with ya. Go, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.75,0:10:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, are you with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.49,0:10:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe this cart is as\Nstrong as our friendship
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.95,0:10:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there's really only one way to find\Nout. Shining friendship in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.71,0:10:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You kept me waiting all this\Ntime for that little butterball?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.79,0:10:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine then, harpy lady, whiplash attack
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.45,0:10:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.77,0:10:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai, I placed a trap, and I remember now\Nwhat it does, so I'm activating Wabaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.93,0:10:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wabaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.01,0:11:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.99,0:11:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and Wabaku reduces the attack points\Nof my opponent's creatures to zero,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.67,0:11:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,so my shining friendship is unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.95,0:11:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I thought they had that move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.03,0:11:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, if by teaching you mean getting\Nschooled every time she beats you with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.31,0:11:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.99,0:11:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.19,0:11:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I am scared up here dueling\Nyou for such incredibly high stakes,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.77,0:11:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,but this card reminded me of something\Nthat helps me face that fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.07,0:11:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.31,0:11:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know with all of them backing me up,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.59,0:11:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I will win.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.61,0:11:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like the card says,\NShining Friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.05,0:11:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how dark things may get,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.15,0:11:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,the special bond I share with my friends\Nwill always find a way to shine through.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.85,0:11:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I may be scared,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.21,0:11:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,but that fear won't\Nkeep me from dueling or
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.89,0:11:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,from helping Yugi or\Nfrom winning this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.59,0:11:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, is any of this stuff getting\Nthrough to you? Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.05,0:12:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya's putting herself on the line\Nfor you Even though she's frightened,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.59,0:12:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,she still battles on
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.43,0:12:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite inspiring, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.75,0:12:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice speech, Taya. In\Nfact, it was so stirring,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.35,0:12:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost feel the need to throw up Can it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.73,0:12:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of your insults.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.97,0:12:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, the magician of faith. I'm playing\Nthis in defense mode. And that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.71,0:12:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm playing the silver bow and arrow\Ncard, which raises my creature 300 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.33,0:12:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.97,0:12:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like I don't\Nhave magic cards, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.49,0:12:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,CyberShield.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.43,0:12:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you think\Nabout this makeover.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.55,0:12:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Harpy Lady's attack\Nwill be 500 points stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.63,0:12:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.63,0:12:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll also play this de-spell card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.93,0:12:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Cupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.15,0:12:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been de-accessorized.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.87,0:12:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.05,0:12:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.09,0:13:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This might be rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.79,0:13:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And I think I'll attack your face-down\Ncard to demolish any hopes you have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.23,0:13:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.14,0:13:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No more hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.25,0:13:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No more faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.39,0:13:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No more chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.51,0:13:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know the rules yet, Taya?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.53,0:13:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I flipped your magician\Nof faith over with my attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.57,0:13:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,you get a card back\Nfrom the graveyard. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.17,0:13:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, how can you seriously hope to\Nbeat me when you don't know the rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.73,0:13:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, honey, I'm sure that everyone's really\Nimpressed that you've lasted this long,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.87,0:13:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,but all you're doing is\Ndelaying the inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.31,0:13:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.57,0:13:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,come on what you're doing is\Npointless yugi's already given
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.43,0:13:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,up on himself you're not going\Nto be able to keep fighting
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.19,0:13:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,for him he has to fight for\Nhimself he has to stand up to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.07,0:14:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,anyone who dares to get in his\Nway and whatever's going on in
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.53,0:14:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,his head teya yugi has to deal\Nwith it on his own what maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.07,0:14:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,my's right maybe i have to\Nfight harder maybe i gave up too
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.93,0:14:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,easily what do you do when the\Nthing you're fighting against
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.73,0:14:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,is some kind of magical spirit\Nthat can take control of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.21,0:14:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Something that's living inside of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.77,0:14:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.37,0:14:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Face it, Teya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.37,0:14:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's checked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.53,0:14:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's given up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.44,0:14:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't care about this match\Nand he doesn't care about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.49,0:14:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing's worth the humiliation\Nyou're going through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.97,0:14:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.88,0:14:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends are
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.81,0:14:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,worth it. Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.97,0:14:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care how much experience\Nyou have playing duel monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.23,0:14:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what the odds\Nare against beating you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.41,0:14:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.77,0:14:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Not on this match and not on Yugi either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.83,0:14:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.35,0:14:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.69,0:14:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.60,0:14:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let these tears fool you, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.75,0:14:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I may be crying, but\NI've never felt stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.03,0:15:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So you better get your star chips\Nready, because I'm about to beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.45,0:15:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's not a thing you\Ncan say or do that'll stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.87,0:15:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have a tendency to run at the\Nmouth, but you've got a lot of spunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.59,0:15:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.03,0:15:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This Elf's Light's a good card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.09,0:15:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It would give me a major power\Nboost to my Shining Friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.53,0:15:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And I also have a D-Spell card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.71,0:15:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I can use that to get rid of my
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.97,0:15:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Cyber Shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.88,0:15:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, since I recovered my Silver\NBow and Arrow from the Graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.61,0:15:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I can add its 300-point\Npower boost to the 400
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.97,0:15:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-point boost that I get\Nfrom my Elf's Light card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.03,0:15:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, my Shining Friendship's\Nattack power will be 2,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.91,0:15:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope that'll be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.35,0:15:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'm playing this silver bow and arrow\Nthat I brought back from the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.29,0:15:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll use Elf's Light\Nto power him up even further.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.05,0:16:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Shining Friendship is\N2,000 attack points strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.89,0:16:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's still not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.75,0:16:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Harpy, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.19,0:16:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.03,0:16:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Or does the magic of Dispel\Nnot apply to you, Mai?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.03,0:16:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack, Shining Friendship,\Nwith Silver Lightning Arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.45,0:16:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.65,0:16:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Bullseye for friendship!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.43,0:16:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What a shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.63,0:16:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Tay's doing better\Nagainst Mai than you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.67,0:16:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.67,0:16:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.73,0:16:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My Harpy's Feather Duster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.35,0:16:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This card could win it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.61,0:16:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Harpy's Feather Duster!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.71,0:17:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I surrender, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.21,0:17:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have the cards to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.27,0:17:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, giving up just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.49,0:17:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't rub it in, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.03,0:17:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Heartbeat Lady was the best monster I had,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.37,0:17:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and seeing as how you beat her,\Nthere's really no point in me going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.57,0:17:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I won! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.83,0:17:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.21,0:17:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You really came through for Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.69,0:17:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.60,0:17:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't need these anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.53,0:17:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Good match.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.43,0:17:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.45,0:17:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.69,0:17:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't the last card...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.19,0:17:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A throwaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.10,0:17:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It was nothing that Teya wouldn't\Nhave been able to beat anyway, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.23,0:17:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.75,0:17:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Some cards just aren't\Nworth playing, huh, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.71,0:17:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.55,0:17:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.99,0:17:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.97,0:17:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I won these star chips for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.67,0:17:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.37,0:17:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.39,0:17:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much. Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.63,0:17:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget what\Nyou did for me, Teya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.99,0:17:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You overcame your fears for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.55,0:18:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And you've given me the\Ncourage to deal with mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.23,0:18:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I will duel again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.55,0:18:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And hopefully the consequences\Nwon't be as bad as I fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.05,0:18:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So take them already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.49,0:18:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making me blush.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.51,0:18:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.42,0:18:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.53,0:18:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.51,0:18:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You really had us worried\Nthere for a while, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.73,0:18:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.23,0:18:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Last one to the castle\Ndoor is a rotten egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.55,0:18:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Let's go! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.91,0:18:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Gangway!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.82,0:18:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You gangway! Hey, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.39,0:18:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And Tristan takes the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.91,0:18:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Not likely.
